{"repo": {"name": {"en-US": "train-libre F-Droid Repo"}, "description": {"en-US": "Automated F-Droid repository for train-libre"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/icons/icon.png", "sha256": "11dc111a8d78af5f8b1b1b357ce9a14cdd6d1dc2b0164fc5330b515194573c7f", "size": 726}}, "address": "https://trainlibre.com/fdroid/repo", "timestamp": 1795524875000, "categories": {"Sports & Health": {"name": {"en-US": "Sports & Health"}}}}, "packages": {"com.rfivesix.trainlibre": {"metadata": {"added": 1795524805000, "categories": ["Sports & Health"], "issueTracker": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre/issues", "lastUpdated": 1795524807000, "license": "GPL-3.0-or-later", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "webSite": "https://github.com/rfivesix/train-libre", "screenshots": {"phone": {"de-DE": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "64d0606bd9642ad8864620a9ed878798ae71cf181cc61d4943ed360841e6449b", "size": 1298076}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "dd792ccbcfc09c9321491383923e040893ad42f3f58848a990996fdbccc05a4b", "size": 2336172}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "2e4330df8fa947b022c25bed70be73769a051d1269bf4cc5131fb7a1c6cda750", "size": 1058272}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "ed9880b510b0e88fdcabf57ba027fd2a34d06a09e6625fbf164321f3360bd8ca", "size": 1623628}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "405f770306cd68067f32b87f8eba66bfde8c72608b0479a070dce08006dc4a33", "size": 1252976}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "b03962e8f5f5ab5447c74854de1e46c991e5397d1df5da255cb6cb4e8ad9a731", "size": 1255058}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "26a4bfa0f5341150e96a4f695a807c40d3ad62f48599dbea0b076ba631edab01", "size": 1641796}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/phoneScreenshots/08.png", "sha256": "b02fe7212e89456c0b3fe2cdeb45334eb1902f301b77ab77f49567f15729886f", "size": 929395}], "en-US": [{"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/01.png", "sha256": "abdaebb6f3fdff1b6fcdc11b20eb5d22e3ce009a438b9bc6379983fa80e21f9a", "size": 1288135}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/02.png", "sha256": "f305022ac4a72cbd564125ba1a75bf935539b46a1cf270bc7eb0ad33c2bbbfa5", "size": 2366209}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/03.png", "sha256": "c21aa1a95683875dc52a17f9b48a6fdb3788599be3ffbfc24728b73f965faa68", "size": 1073230}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/04.png", "sha256": "3d1f5e69a7471a69c744e92c9daaed936f48d059e390c180bdc6bcc6ac6bb8be", "size": 1596725}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/05.png", "sha256": "7d991f5b40805baedfec42600be6697cd9a749a6af1170373272abc5d250f1db", "size": 1224658}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/06.png", "sha256": "6f42dee26e31725ec8574b88d5ac6b62c9191682a3206f242ba0eff92e73efb0", "size": 1291300}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/07.png", "sha256": "d96e9a8be67d149428f0f16157ebfd1f9192bc86ba7dae62b4e9b6c5d0c870ae", "size": 1655338}, {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/phoneScreenshots/08.png", "sha256": "01fc60bf9da5b68045d10a547e1d8e5f63a3b2a6fd6ac564b6ff1de233d2e0bc", "size": 890023}]}}, "name": {"en-US": "Train Libre", "de-DE": "Train Libre"}, "summary": {"en-US": "Open-source workout and nutrition tracker with local-first data.", "de-DE": "Open-Source Tracker für Training und Ernährung mit lokalen Daten."}, "description": {"en-US": "Train Libre is an open-source, offline-first workout and nutrition tracker that keeps you in control of your data. Log workouts and meals without an account. Your data is stored locally on your device.\n\nFEATURES\n- Log workouts set by set, build routines and training plans, and follow your progress and personal records.\n- See completed and planned sets by muscle group and training volume during a workout.\n- Track meals, calories, macros, fluids, caffeine, supplements, bodyweight, and measurements. Enter macros manually or search food catalogs.\n- Explore training, nutrition, sleep, steps, pulse, and recovery statistics where data is available.\n- Optionally sync supported health data, including nutrition, with Health Connect.\n- Use optional AI meal analysis and chat with your own provider credentials. Review suggestions before saving and approve requests for personal app data.\n- Export and restore local backups.\n\nTrain Libre is open source, has no mandatory cloud account, and is built for structured training. Optional usage statistics are off by default.\n\nTrain Libre is not a medical app. Recovery, sleep, and other physical metrics are for personal training guidance, not medical diagnosis or treatment.\n\nThe app uses community catalogs including Open Food Facts and OpenExerciseDB. Source code is publicly available.\n", "de-DE": "Train Libre ist ein quelloffener Offline-first-Tracker für Training und Ernährung. Protokolliere Workouts und Mahlzeiten ohne Konto und behalte die Kontrolle über deine Daten: Sie werden lokal auf deinem Gerät gespeichert.\n\nFUNKTIONEN\n- Protokolliere Workouts Satz für Satz, erstelle Routinen und Trainingspläne und verfolge Fortschritte und persönliche Bestleistungen.\n- Sieh während des Trainings abgeschlossene und geplante Sätze nach Muskelgruppe sowie dein Trainingsvolumen.\n- Erfasse Mahlzeiten, Kalorien, Makros, Flüssigkeit, Koffein, Supplements, Körpergewicht und Körpermaße. Gib Makros manuell ein oder durchsuche Lebensmittelkataloge.\n- Entdecke Statistiken zu Training, Ernährung, Schlaf, Schritten, Puls und Erholung, sofern Daten verfügbar sind.\n- Synchronisiere unterstützte Gesundheitsdaten einschließlich Ernährung optional mit Health Connect.\n- Nutze optional KI-Mahlzeitenanalyse und Chat mit eigenen Zugangsdaten. Prüfe Vorschläge vor dem Speichern und stimme Anfragen nach persönlichen App-Daten zu.\n- Exportiere und stelle lokale Backups wieder her.\n\nTrain Libre ist Open Source, benötigt kein Cloud-Konto und unterstützt strukturiertes Training. Optionale Nutzungsstatistiken sind standardmäßig deaktiviert.\n\nTrain Libre ist keine medizinische App. Erholungs-, Schlaf- und andere Körperwerte dienen der persönlichen Trainingsorientierung und sind keine medizinische Diagnose oder Behandlung.\n\nDie App nutzt Community-Kataloge wie Open Food Facts und OpenExerciseDB. Der Quellcode ist öffentlich verfügbar.\n"}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/en-US/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}, "de-DE": {"name": "/com.rfivesix.trainlibre/de-DE/icon_BDpnPPO5DCAteR-f5uh6yr8SZKF_miQjdDozt7si38I=.png", "sha256": "043a673cf3b90c202d791f9fe6e87acabf1264a17f9a2423743a33b7bb22dfc2", "size": 13030}}, "preferredSigner": "7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"}, "versions": {"abd5bfe23b592e852379284eaf4c5f0e02b5426a70c3f4757016b6ecc65db51c": {"added": 1795524807000, "file": {"name": "/app-x86_64-release.apk", "sha256": "abd5bfe23b592e852379284eaf4c5f0e02b5426a70c3f4757016b6ecc65db51c", "size": 46975096}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["x86_64"], "versionName": "1.7.1-beta.4", "versionCode": 1011034, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 36}, "signer": {"sha256": ["7bea1cc437d23ad86535001c2996c22def49d8d75bd6b4942b6aad59572b17cc"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO"}, {"name": "android.permission.READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 32}, {"name": "android.permission.WRITE_EXTERNAL_STORAGE", "maxSdkVersion": 28}, {"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS"}, {"name": "android.permission.SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM"}, {"name": "android.p